  "bodyHash": "c253c13bdc0fce8f",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquamirae-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=231C25&color=3d215c\"></a>\n</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">《Aquamirae》为你的世界增添了一片冰封海洋生态群系——上方是冰迷宫，下方则是令人毛骨悚然的沉船墓地。在探索中揭开科妮莉亚船长的命运之谜，于冰层之下潜伏的恐怖中求生，并发现其独特的生态系统、进度系统、环境氛围与背景故事。</h2>\n<p><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Rn2RuE.png\"></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<h2>“曾经无垠的海洋，其波涛曾由狂风自深渊掀起；曾被勇敢的航海者与可怕的掠夺者舰队航行过的海洋，如今已被冰雪禁锢。<h2>时间仿佛在此冻结……那些不幸者的船只被冻结在无情的冰层中，与此同时，恐怖的生物也从深渊爬出，重见天日。暴风雪中，唯有那些仍期盼救援之人的号角声零星可闻。究竟是何种力量，将曾经自由奔放的海洋变得如此面目全非？”</h2>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1554/812/1-jpg.jpg\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">冰迷宫</h1>\n        <p>一座冰冻的迷宫矗立在沉船墓地之上，形成了一个充满危险与秘密的双层生态群系。探索蜿蜒的走廊、坍塌的甲板、隐秘的密室，以及被冰层掩埋的寂静残骸。</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">建筑与氛围</h1>\n        <p>从废弃营地到巨大的冰冻残骸，生态群系的每个角落都提供了可供探索的地方与待解的故事。定制音乐、诡异的背景音效与飘落的雪花，让每次探险都成为一场沉浸式的旅程。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/465/325/2022-05-29_02.png\" width=\"60%\">\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JX9sj7Z.jpeg\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">冰下生物</h1>\n        <p>深渊的恐怖造物已浮出水面，迫使当地的掠夺者舰队躲藏起来。这些生物不仅栖息于迷宫之中——它们更会从冰层下涌出，将任何胆敢靠近的人逼向最偏远的角落以寻求庇护。</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">科妮莉亚船长</h1>\n        <p>幽灵船长以流畅的动作与致命的技能守护着沉船墓地的核心。她的悲剧故事通过环境与遗留的宝藏逐步展开。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mvanajZ.png\" width=\"60%\">\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/400/787/2021-10-12_03.png\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">宝藏与自定义</h1>\n        <p>发现散落在生态群系各处的独特武器、带有特殊加成的护甲套装以及稀有饰品。支持完整的配置文件，你可以精细调整生成规则、难度、战利品及各项功能，使其完美契合你的世界。</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gaxlKkX.png\"></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cCXV545X/b5b15a5fdab90a6075408aae2ed1c204dbcf0043.png\" width=\"20%\" height=\"20%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquamirae-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquamirae Delight</a> by tinfoilknight</h2>\n        <p>Aquamirae Delight 是一款为《Farmer's Delight》与《Aquamirae》提供的兼容模组。它在保留两款模组主题、食材与玩法风格的基础上，引入了新菜肴与改良配方，力求呈现贴合原版风格的生存体验。</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ZBaOT4.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AWVa1rL.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0F3Uyq.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillager-caravans\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lPK6BrB.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elixirum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zMZKr3b.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjJSLI0.png\" width=\"45%\">\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4lV9g9R.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Y7y8mO.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p>",
